(  111) !      N.Semane+P.Bechtold    04-10-2012 Add RPLRG/RPLDARE factors for small planet
(  112) !      M. Leutbecher & S.-J. Lock (Jan 2016) Introduced SPP scheme (LSPP)
(  113) !      S.-J. Lock (01 Nov 2016) SPP bug fix for ENTRORG perturbations
(  114) !      M. Leutbecher (Oct 2020) SPP abstraction
(  115) !      20210913 : Modifications for Arpege Y.Bouteloup (LDTDKMF)
(  116) !     R. El Khatib 22-Jun-2022 A contribution to simplify phasing after the refactoring of YOMCLI/YOMCST/YOETHF.
